  notes: >-
    Infrastructure that turns verified carbon credits into digital tokens;
    per the article, accounts for roughly 85% of digital carbon-credit
    volume and has supported ~$4B in trading volume, working alongside Gold
    Standard and Puro.earth. Involved in a 2023 Verra policy dispute over
    tokenizing already-retired credits (see linked claim-evidence).
